					<description><![CDATA[Cuerpo Inmenso and Aguas are two songs that arrived in the midst of acute political grief in 2021 during state-sanctioned human rights abuses against Indigenous people in Colombia and Brazil.&#160; These prayer songs ask us to sense the sharp edge of our denial and the heavy weight of our arrogance and to do so with &#8230; <p class="link-more"><a href="https://decolonialfutures.net/2023/06/23/prayer-songs/" class="more-link">Continue reading<span class="screen-reader-text"> "Prayer songs for difficult&#160;times."</span></a></p>]]></description>
